\fBAsync Cancel Safety: AC-Unsafe lock\fP This function is not safe to call from threads that may be asynchronously cancelled, due to the use of a mutex initialization routine\&. If STUMPLESS_THREAD_SAFETY_SUPPORTED is not defined, then this function is AC-Safe\&.
.PP
\fBSince\fP
.RS 4
release v2\&.2\&.0
.RE
.PP
\fBParameters\fP
.RS 4
\fIelement\fP The struct to load\&.
.br
\fIname\fP The name of the element\&.
.RE
